# GraphWaterfall

## Import

```svelte
import { GraphWaterfall } from 'markgraphy';
```

## Basic usage

```svelte
<GraphWaterfall
  title="example"
  ticks={24}
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `title` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `items` | `WaterfallItem[]` | `—` | — |
| `ticks?` | `number` | `24` | — |
| `glyphs?` | `Glyphs` | `—` | — |
| `palette?` | `GraphPalette` | `—` | — |
| `corner?` | `string` | `—` | — |
| `class?` | `string` | `''` | — |

## Exported types

- `WaterfallKind`
- `WaterfallItem`
- `GraphWaterfallProps`
